l":"Planung 2025–2028 (auf Italienisch) (PDF 54.73 KB)","href":"/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/relint-prorettorato-usi-pianificazione-25-28.pdf"}],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/relint/international-relations/internationalization-strategy-goals","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:55:03.402Z","translated":true}